{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-terraces-sobha-realty-sobha-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1451,"crm_id":"3270","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Terraces","slug":"the-terraces-sobha-realty-sobha-city","display_address":"Sobha City","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":4960000,"display_price":"4.96M","lattitude":25.613117663271,"longitude":55.637150884538,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Terraces at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/sobha-city/\">Sobha City</a> introduces a refined collection of <strong>3 and 4-bedroom garden villas</strong> designed for expansive, nature-connected living. Developed by Sobha Realty, these residences are shaped by openness, natural light, and privacy, with private backyards and elevated terraces seamlessly extending indoor spaces into lush outdoor environments.</p><p>The Terraces by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-sobha-realty/\">Sobha Realty</a> is positioned as a high capital appreciation opportunity within a master-planned ecosystem where nature and lifestyle coexist. Residents will enjoy curated amenities including an amphitheatre, pavilion, open-air gym, and forest trails, all designed to support everyday wellness and social interaction within a thoughtfully integrated setting.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_e8795059c7.jpg","hash":"Feature_e8795059c7","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_962153eb9b.jpg","hash":"Banner_962153eb9b","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-prov