estyle destinations.</li><li>Expansive Garden Villas – 3 and 4-bedroom residences designed with layered spaces, private gardens, and seamless indoor-outdoor living.</li><li>Integrated Community Living – Thoughtfully planned social spaces including amphitheatres, pavilions, and communal zones encourage natural interaction.</li><li>Private Lifestyle Amenities – Each villa features private backyards, lifts in select units, and panoramic green vistas enhancing daily living.</li><li>Nature-Led Masterplan – Forest trails, cycling loops, and landscaped green corridors shape a wellness-focused living environment.</li><li>Developer Excellence – Developed by Sobha Realty, known for precision construction and long-term value-driven communities.</li><li>Payment Plan – Structured 60/40 plan designed to offer ease of investment with phased payments during construction.</li><li>High Capital Appreciation – Located within a master-planned city designed for long-term growth and sustained investment potential.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2145,"cta":{"id":2983,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_acc29f709e.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_acc29f709e","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Connected Living in a Strategic Abu Dhabi Address","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Sobha Terraces Abu Dhabi is located within Sobha City in Al Bahyah, offering excellent connectivity via Sheikh Zayed Bin Sultan Street (E10) and Sheikh Maktoum Bin Rashid Road (E11). This prime positioning ensures smooth access to major attractions, business hubs, and lifestyle destinations across Abu Dhabi while maintaining a serene residential setting.</p><ul><li>13 Minutes – Yas Mall</li><li>14 Minutes – Zayed International